Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:52:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD visual-mode clipboard selection so terminal panes
 support vim-style yanks

Keep terminal selection state in the UI layer for character, line, and block selections across the focused pane. Rendering highlights the selected range and yanks emit an OSC 52 clipboard payload without changing controller or backend workflow state.
